  message: "Implemented in PR from commit f46c0610d. Auto-import from io_primitives (both sides: env_read/net_recv/ipc_recv → sources, fs_write/net_send/subprocess/env_write/ipc_send/browser_storage_write → sinks) with user YAML override semantics. New trust zones host_env, ipc, browser_storage; new taint labels host_secret, untrusted_input. Browser storage recategorized into new io_primitives category browser_storage_write (Q3 option 3). WI-hizik drift-guard torn down (structurally impossible now). 1357 affected tests pass at 100% coverage. End-to-end test confirms os.environ → pathlib.Path.write_text produces a TaintFlowFinding with label=host_secret."  # 528c
